  "title": "Expand Counter Attribute Functionality [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "カウンター属性の機能を拡張【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "32ae4f2a50377003dd9214f34768f11316a6a5704891bda2e9ba3251c2e207fe",
      "translation": "Expand Counter Attribute Functionality [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "32ae4f2a50377003dd9214f34768f11316a6a5704891bda2e9ba3251c2e207fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクールＭＶ～ＭＺではタイルにカウンター属性を付加しても、１マス離れた相手にしか話しかけられません。",
      "sourceHash": "476661775018d04534cb859aa727f6e39bb114af89b818e835a9628e3902f685",
      "translation": "In RPG Maker MV–MZ, even if you add the Counter attribute to a tile, you can only talk to someone one tile away.",
      "contextHash": "476661775018d04534cb859aa727f6e39bb114af89b818e835a9628e3902f685"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクール２０００など昔のツクールでは、もっと遠くの相手とも会話できたのになぜ……。",
      "sourceHash": "2af8c8dc1595fd909ebe8a411c8944bef930337ebacfca95da9a28fc8f3b3d98",
      "translation": "Why could you talk to people farther away in older versions of RPG Maker, such as RPG Maker 2000...?",
      "contextHash": "2af8c8dc1595fd909ebe8a411c8944bef930337ebacfca95da9a28fc8f3b3d98"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "というわけで、カウンター属性の有効範囲を延長するのがこのプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "ee5ad42a165335494f19348db8c57b7bc536c57226477737c6d815543e792e70",
      "translation": "That is why this plugin extends the effective range of the Counter attribute.",
      "contextHash": "ee5ad42a165335494f19348db8c57b7bc536c57226477737c6d815543e792e70"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、A2タイルかつカウンター属性のタイルがテーブルとして判定され、12ドット長さが延長されるツクールの仕様を無効化できます。",
      "sourceHash": "d1a2449279e98d42aab4cd3f0f1ca363b785344dc5aca71902826e8e045997a5",
      "translation": "It can also disable RPG Maker's behavior of treating tiles that are both A2 tiles and have the Counter attribute as tables, extending their length by 12 pixels.",
      "contextHash": "d1a2449279e98d42aab4cd3f0f1ca363b785344dc5aca71902826e8e045997a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature on from RPG Maker's Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※いずれのプラグインもＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "22618a56102a594c722145199f7ab1565103da056daac564257d33f1e0b8ee7a",
      "translation": "※Both plugins work in MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "22618a56102a594c722145199f7ab1565103da056daac564257d33f1e0b8ee7a"
    },
