    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "１マス離れた座標からカウンターが反応してしまう不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "094ed51bf46b3784d49f59a6feef68db22c4d6fc9003c3e888b5c05f8414b747",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where the Counter reacted from coordinates one tile away.",
      "contextHash": "094ed51bf46b3784d49f59a6feef68db22c4d6fc9003c3e888b5c05f8414b747"
    },
    {
