    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "必要な機能をプラグインパラメータでオンにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "e344db5eb894979a3c87b008fd10ae615fc3969a2fdf10d841aa6a37afbea14f",
      "translation": "Turn on the required features in the plugin parameters.",
      "contextHash": "e344db5eb894979a3c87b008fd10ae615fc3969a2fdf10d841aa6a37afbea14f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期状態では『カウンターの範囲延長』のみがオンになっています。",
      "sourceHash": "0f71e2a1ff536e72ad14894ecbc701752ee679d616ffe3e74933cafb63954168",
      "translation": "Initially, only “Counter Extension” is enabled.",
      "contextHash": "0f71e2a1ff536e72ad14894ecbc701752ee679d616ffe3e74933cafb63954168"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ",
      "sourceHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters",
      "contextHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "カウンターの範囲延長（CounterExtension）",
      "sourceHash": "a8ef14ec8fb6a8cec0f70ad050a59b513d5aa92f1275866d9d6d051d2530e264",
      "translation": "Counter Extension (CounterExtension)",
      "contextHash": "a8ef14ec8fb6a8cec0f70ad050a59b513d5aa92f1275866d9d6d051d2530e264"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "カウンター属性の有効範囲を延長し、２マス以上離れたイベントを起動できるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "88fa4bf8566250cb4375ce42c950b5434b642785f65b7121b2235c3e51838a9b",
      "translation": "Extends the effective range of the Counter attribute, allowing events two or more tiles away to be activated.",
      "contextHash": "88fa4bf8566250cb4375ce42c950b5434b642785f65b7121b2235c3e51838a9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "テーブル画像を延長しない（TableImageNotExtension）",
      "sourceHash": "69e02491c6449517f59554638f34e74490b172229597c8dd775cf945d445c59c",
      "translation": "Do Not Extend Table Images (TableImageNotExtension)",
      "contextHash": "69e02491c6449517f59554638f34e74490b172229597c8dd775cf945d445c59c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "テーブルタイルを12ドット延長する仕様を無効化します。",
      "sourceHash": "5b7dc6543de79abcf72d92efcacbdd5d18aafcf72338b4151d11b6bae7e9f91a",
      "translation": "Disables the behavior of extending table tiles by 12 pixels.",
      "contextHash": "5b7dc6543de79abcf72d92efcacbdd5d18aafcf72338b4151d11b6bae7e9f91a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※参考：ツクールＭＺのヘルプの素材規格",
      "sourceHash": "993010e213d69c71a1ba83577d4f50d04aca3a4dcb297f2e200862421f635d39",
      "translation": "※Reference: RPG Maker MZ Help—Asset Specifications",
      "contextHash": "993010e213d69c71a1ba83577d4f50d04aca3a4dcb297f2e200862421f635d39"
    }
